<title>USA: N.Y. cert cotton stocks drop 88 bales to 103,066.</title>
<headline>N.Y. cert cotton stocks drop 88 bales to 103,066.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable  against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as  of July 31 totaled 103,066 bales, down from 103,094 bales the previous  session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 88 cancellations,  and 401 decertification orders. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
